  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 310
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这颗“血煞丹”是老夫从巫山换得的秘药，有短暂提升修为的作用，你且收着。若是我那死敌真的寻来，我自有办法与他周旋。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114256675112714775}
  AvatarIntID: 0
